#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Fail-closed R5 object-only source runner.

R5 consumes the frozen Protected Source Boundary evidence.  It never loads a
scanner, enumerates arbitrary tree names, or recomputes protected-path policy.
Authoring and review use only --self-test and --fixture.  --actual additionally
requires a later, exact Jenn execution decision at a fixed workspace path.
"""

